  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;pass through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and is perpendicular to the planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;are integers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math>",
